<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 239 0 R/E(FILE 001 / PROLOGUE)/Pg 11 0 R/K[1]>>
endobj

281 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 239 0 R/E(A Prologue)/Pg 11 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

282 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 239 0 R/T(A suit should feel chosen.)/E(A suit should feel chosen.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

283 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 239 0 R/E(The Blueprint is not a rulebook for becoming somebody else. It is a foundation for becoming more intentional about yourself.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

284 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 239 0 R/E(We will show you the foundations, the combinations, the rules, and why the pieces work together. But ultimately, you decide. Learn the rules. Understand why they exist. Then make them your own. Because style without ownership is costume.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

285 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 239 0 R/E(Style with ownership becomes identity.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

286 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 239 0 R/E(Learn it. Tailor it. Personalize it.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

287 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 239 0 R/E(Wear it. Live in it. Then stop thinking about the suit and get on with the reason you got dressed in the first place. And when you walk through the door, don't ask the room whether you belong there.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

288 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 239 0 R/E(Know why you came)/Pg 11 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

289 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 239 0 R/E(OWN THE SUIT.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

